---
// Back matter — the old press convention of announcing a companion work
// issued in matching binding: "uniform with this volume." Literally true
// here; the two sites share one design language. Printed, not stamped:
// no entrance motion, hover states only.
---

<aside class="companion" aria-label="Companion project">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="mono-label companion-label">Uniform with this volume</p>
    <div class="companion-plate">
      <div class="companion-marks" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="companion-chip">
          {/* the companion's press mark: the pen */}
          <svg viewBox="22 12 56 98" width="16" height="28">
            <path fill="#fbf9f3" d="M 22 21 Q 50 12 78 21 L 78 34 C 78 44 76 50 74 56 C 66 74 55 90 50 110 C 45 90 34 74 26 56 C 24 50 22 44 22 34 Z"/>
            <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="8.4" fill="var(--seal)"/>
            <rect x="48.2" y="50" width="3.6" height="68" fill="var(--seal)"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="companion-chip">
          {/* this volume's press mark: the arch */}
          <svg viewBox="4 8 92 88" width="27" height="26">
            <path fill="#fbf9f3" d="M 10 90 L 10 82 L 14 82 L 14 52 A 36 36 0 0 1 86 52 L 86 82 L 90 82 L 90 90 L 62 90 L 62 82 L 66 82 L 66 52 A 16 16 0 0 0 34 52 L 34 82 L 38 82 L 38 90 Z"/>
            <line x1="39.3" y1="14.5" x2="46.4" y2="39.5" stroke="var(--seal)" stroke-width="3.2"/>
            <line x1="60.7" y1="14.5" x2="53.6" y2="39.5" stroke="var(--seal)" stroke-width="3.2"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="companion-copy">
        <h2 class="companion-name">Agent Constitution</h2>
        <p class="companion-tagline">&ldquo;Write the law your agents build under.&rdquo;</p>
        <p class="companion-note">
          The companion project, from the same press: the constitution
          governs a project's direction and values; canon keeps its
          architectural invariants and the reasons behind them. The law
          steers. The record holds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="companion-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://agentconstitution.dev" rel="noopener">
          Visit the site
        </a>
        <a
          class="companion-repo"
          href="https://github.com/stefan-vatov/agentconstitution"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="Agent Constitution repository on GitHub"
        >
          github.com/stefan-vatov/agentconstitution
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
